{{-
  hostname = model.props.hostname
  state    = model.props.enabledstate
  extra_fm = ""
  if hostname
    extra_fm = "hostname: " + hostname
  end
  if state
    extra_fm = extra_fm + (extra_fm != "" ? "\n" : "") + "state: " + state
  end
-}}
# {{ model.name }}

## ℹ️ Configuration

| Property | Value |
|---|---|
{{ if hostname -}}
| **Hostname** | `{{ hostname }}` |
{{ end -}}
{{ if state -}}
| **State** | `{{ state }}` |
{{ end -}}

## 🔌 Connections

{{ for edge in model.inbound | filter_by_label "child resource" -}}
* **AFD Profile:** {{ edge.wiki }}
{{ end -}}
{{ for edge in model.outbound | filter_by_label "child resource" -}}
* **Child:** {{ edge.wiki }}
{{ end -}}
